      "title": "GitLab CI: Add a GCC Coverity Scan Build job.",
      "message": "GitLab CI: Add a GCC Coverity Scan Build job.\n\nAdd a \"coverity-gcc\" job which runs Coverity Scan Build on Ubuntu using\nGCC and submits the build output to Coverity. Based on\n\nhttps://www.synopsys.com/blogs/software-security/integrating-coverity-scan-with-gitlab-ci\n\nand\n\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/blob/8f57a5b9/.gitlab-ci.yml#L481\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2021-04-29T12:10:51.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-04-29T23:27:24.000+00:00",
